00:31:48.190 --> 00:31:48.900
participating.

00:31:48.900 --> 00:31:53.260
I think we are all here because we love
the school, and we love our community, and

00:31:53.260 --> 00:31:57.850
we would be super excited to see some of
you all apply and ultimately come here.

